    "text": "BY virtue of the power vested in under Sections 171, 173 and 184 of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act No. 15 of 1987, read alongwith the Section 2 of the Provincial Councils (Consequential Provisions) No. 12 of 1989, it is hereby notified underSection 184(3) of the said Pradeshiya Sabha Act that the order, approved by the Minister in charge of the subject LocalGovernment, which was published in the Extraordinary Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri LankaNo. 1976/3 and dated 18th July 2016, is hereby seconded by the Central Provincial Council on 20.09.2016, under Sub-section 184(2) of the said Act, read along with Section 2 of the Provincial Councils Act, No. 12 of 1989.",
